msgstr "Fraktjakt testläge"

#. module: delivery_fraktjakt
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_fraktjakt.field_res_company__fraktjakt_test_mode
msgid ""
"When enabled, all calls are logged extra verbosely and a banner is shown "
"on shipping bookings. The actual test mode is enabled in Fraktjakt's UI on "
"the integration level."
